    # v0.119.54 / Wave 22 — closes the v0.119.53 fresh-agent benchmark
    # (27th attempt, <half-duplex-tester> byte[6]=0x02 FAIL despite Wave-21 altsyncram
    # OTP loaded + 1024 memory bits). Root cause: top-level RX path used
